@host = http://localhost:5050

### =========================================
### L03: Postel's Law - Forward Compatibility
### =========================================

### FORWARD COMPATIBILITY - request z EXTRA polem
POST {{host}}/v2/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Forward Compatibility",
  "description": "Testing Postels Law",
  "category": "Support",
  "name": "Jan Kowalski",
  "email": "jan@example.com",
  "futureField": "pole ktorego serwer nie zna - zignoruje"
}


### =========================================
### L03: Hyrum's Law
### =========================================
### V1 brak email → framework exception (stack trace)
### Oczekiwany response: 400 z BadHttpRequestException
GET {{host}}/v1/inquiries

###

### V2 brak email → Problem Details (RFC 7807)
GET {{host}}/v2/inquiries

### -----------------------------------------
### L03: V1 vs V2
### -----------------------------------------

### V1 lista - camelCase, "data" wrapper, string date
GET {{host}}/v1/inquiries?email=jan@example.com

###

### V2 lista - camelCase, "items" wrapper, DateTimeOffset
### Nowe pola: estimatedResponseTime, supportTier
GET {{host}}/v2/inquiries?email=jan@example.com


### -----------------------------------------
### OpenAPI + Scalar UI
### -----------------------------------------

### OpenAPI V1 (wszystkie operacje deprecated)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

###

### OpenAPI V2 (aktualna)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v2.json

### Scalar UI:
### V1 (deprecated): http://localhost:5050/scalar/v1
### V2 (current):    http://localhost:5050/scalar/v2
